ce":"費無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001929","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001931","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"郤宛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"宛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001980","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"伯氏子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001981","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001933","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001934","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p048","text":"十年冬，呉王闔閭、伍子胥、伯與唐、蔡倶伐楚，楚大敗，呉兵遂入郢，辱平王之墓，以伍子胥故也。呉兵之來，楚使子常以兵迎之，夾漢水陣。呉伐敗子常，子常亡奔鄭。楚兵走，呉乘勝逐之，五戰及郢。己卯，昭王出奔。庚辰，呉人入郢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"呉王闔閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001933","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"伯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"本版僅作伯，未補嚭字或直接連到他篇伯嚭；需核對版本與同一伐楚事件。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001933","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001934","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001934","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001934","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m048-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p084","text":"十八年，楚人有好以弱弓微繳加歸鴈之上者，頃襄王聞，召而問之。對曰：「小臣之好射鶀鴈，羅鸗，小矢之發也，何足爲大王道也。且稱楚之大，因大王之賢，所弋非直此也。昔者三王以弋道德，五霸以弋戰國。故秦、魏、燕、趙者，鶀鴈也；齊、魯、韓、衞者，靑首也；騶、費、郯、邳者，羅鸗也。外其餘則不足射者。見鳥六雙，以王何取？王何不以聖人爲弓，以勇士爲繳，時張而射之？此六雙者，可得而囊載也。其樂非特朝昔之樂也，其獲非特鳧鴈之實也。王朝張弓而射魏之大梁之南，加其右臂而徑屬之於韓，則中國之路絶而上蔡之郡壞矣。還射圉之東，解魏左肘而外撃定陶，則魏之東外棄而大宋、方與二郡者舉矣。且魏斷二臂，顛越矣；膺撃郯國，大梁可得而有也。王綪繳蘭臺，飲馬西河，定魏大梁，此一發之樂也。若王之於弋誠好而不厭，則出寶弓，碆新繳，射噣鳥於東海，還蓋長城以爲防，朝射東莒，夕發浿丘，夜加卽墨，顧據午道，則長城之東收而太山之北舉矣。西結境於趙而北達於燕，三國布鶴，則從不待約而可成也。北遊目於燕之遼東而南登望於越之會稽，此再發之樂也。若夫泗上十二諸侯，左縈而右拂之，可一旦而盡也。今秦破韓以爲長憂，得列城而不敢守也；伐魏而無功，撃趙而顧病，則秦魏之勇力屈矣，楚之故地漢中、析、酈可得而復有也。王出寶弓，碆新繳，渉鄳塞，而待秦之倦也，山東、河内可得而一也。勞民休衆，南面稱王矣。故曰秦爲大鳥，負海内而處，東面而立，左臂據趙之西南，右臂傅楚鄢郢，膺撃韓魏，垂頭中國，處旣形便，勢有地利，奮翼鼓鶴，方三千里，則秦未可得獨招而夜射也。」欲以激怒襄王，故對以此言。襄王因召與語，遂言曰：「夫先王爲秦所欺而客死於外，怨莫大焉。今以匹夫有怨，尚有報萬乘，白公、子胥是也。今楚之地方五千里，帶甲百萬，猶足以踴躍中野也，而坐受困，臣竊爲大王弗取也。」於是頃襄王遣使於諸侯，復爲從，欲以伐秦。秦聞之，發兵來伐楚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0004","start":4,"end":19,"surface":"楚人有好以弱弓微繳加歸鴈之上者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001963","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"頃襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"三王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、寓言人物或未定指代，未補未見姓名、全體成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"五霸","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、寓言人物或未定指代，未補未見姓名、全體成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0149","start":149,"end":150,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0206","start":206,"end":207,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0301","start":301,"end":302,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0325","start":325,"end":326,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0523","start":523,"end":524,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0645","start":645,"end":647,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0654","start":654,"end":656,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0667","start":667,"end":669,"surface":"先王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0697","start":697,"end":699,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0700","start":700,"end":702,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001933","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0736","start":736,"end":738,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m084-0745","start":745,"end":748,"surface":"頃襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-040","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","source":{"title":"史記／卷040","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷040","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷040&oldid=8736796","revision_id":8736796,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"96段正文及1段分層索隱述贊；排除2個dd導覽，去除段落外緣空白。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"笔":"筆"},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"固定修訂與取得時HTML一致；僅去除段落外緣空白，古代異體及校勘括號保留。 第70段笔轉筆，未將「西取筆秦」疑句自行校讀。","note":"全97段數位正文已核讀，人物標註與可靠底本、影像覆核尚未完成；不把數位轉錄當版本校定。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":true}}
